      398.77,
      539.95,
      493.84
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by thisOrder, amend the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1482/26 of February 02, 2007 (as lastamended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1960/8 of March 29, 2016), which specifies the Faculties andthe Departments of the University of Peradeniya, Sri Lanka, which is deemed by virtue of the provisions of Section 139 ofthe aforesaid Act, to be a University established under Section 21 of the said Act, by the substitution for the entry \u201c2.Department of Anesthesiology\u201d appearing in Column II of the Schedule which corresponds to the item \u201cFaculty of Medicine\u201dappearing in Column I of the Schedule of the following entry :-",
